100: * `maxParticipants` is a TEAM limit, so doubles/mixed divisions report
101: * fractional `occupiedTeamSlots`: one active roster member holds half a team.
102: * WAITLISTED and terminal states reserve nothing. Aggregates only — the
103: * projection never carries participant identity. `_count.participants` and
104: * `_summary.participantCount` stay plain participant row counts.
